<title>ITALY: SOCCER-BARCELONA'S NADAL SENT OFF.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BARCELONA'S NADAL SENT OFF.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barcelona defender Miguel Angel Nadal was sent off in the 83rd minute of a European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal second leg on Thursday.</p>
<p>Fiorentina's Luis Oliveira was earlier sent off in the 48th minute for his second booking of the match.</p>
<p>Barcelona were winning 2-0 and 3-1 on aggregate.</p>
